1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,945
Hello, little friends! I'm Kiddo!

2
00:00:03,345 --> 00:00:05,209
Today, let's play a shadow game!

3
00:00:05,609 --> 00:00:08,344
Look at the shadow, and guess the animal. Ready?

4
00:00:10,244 --> 00:00:12,261
Whose shadow is this? Can you guess?

5
00:00:12,661 --> 00:00:14,267
It has a long, long trunk!

6
00:00:20,067 --> 00:00:21,491
Yes! It's an elephant!

7
00:00:21,991 --> 00:00:23,613
Say it with me! Elephant!

8
00:00:25,413 --> 00:00:26,976
Elephants are big and strong!

9
00:00:29,076 --> 00:00:31,094
Whose shadow is this? Can you guess?

10
00:00:31,494 --> 00:00:32,851
It has a very long neck!

11
00:00:38,651 --> 00:00:40,112
Yes! It's a giraffe!

12
00:00:40,612 --> 00:00:42,242
Say it with me! Giraffe!

13
00:00:44,042 --> 00:00:45,771
Giraffes are very, very tall!

14
00:00:47,871 --> 00:00:49,889
Whose shadow is this? Can you guess?

15
00:00:50,289 --> 00:00:52,576
It has long ears and goes hop, hop!

16
00:00:58,376 --> 00:00:59,668
Yes! It's a rabbit!

17
00:01:00,168 --> 00:01:01,640
Say it with me! Rabbit!

18
00:01:03,440 --> 00:01:05,065
Rabbits love to eat carrots!

19
00:01:07,165 --> 00:01:09,182
Whose shadow is this? Can you guess?

20
00:01:09,582 --> 00:01:11,178
It carries its house on its back!

21
00:01:16,978 --> 00:01:18,319
Yes! It's a turtle!

22
00:01:18,819 --> 00:01:20,308
Say it with me! Turtle!

23
00:01:22,108 --> 00:01:23,911
Turtles walk slowly, slowly!

24
00:01:26,011 --> 00:01:28,028
Whose shadow is this? Can you guess?

25
00:01:28,428 --> 00:01:31,374
It has pretty wings and flies from flower to flower!

26
00:01:37,174 --> 00:01:38,680
Yes! It's a butterfly!

27
00:01:39,180 --> 00:01:40,938
Say it with me! Butterfly!

28
00:01:42,738 --> 00:01:44,615
Butterflies have colorful wings!

29
00:01:46,715 --> 00:01:48,732
Whose shadow is this? Can you guess?

30
00:01:49,132 --> 00:01:51,062
It says cock-a-doodle-doo in the morning!

31
00:01:56,862 --> 00:01:58,221
Yes! It's a rooster!

32
00:01:58,721 --> 00:02:00,288
Say it with me! Rooster!

33
00:02:02,088 --> 00:02:03,904
Roosters wake us up in the morning!

34
00:02:06,004 --> 00:02:08,021
Whose shadow is this? Can you guess?

35
00:02:08,421 --> 00:02:09,734
It swims in the water!

36
00:02:15,534 --> 00:02:16,760
Yes! It's a fish!

37
00:02:17,260 --> 00:02:18,643
Say it with me! Fish!

38
00:02:20,443 --> 00:02:21,708
Fish live in the water!

39
00:02:23,808 --> 00:02:25,826
Whose shadow is this? Can you guess?

40
00:02:26,226 --> 00:02:27,471
It says meow, meow!

41
00:02:33,271 --> 00:02:34,552
Yes! It's a cat!

42
00:02:35,052 --> 00:02:36,447
Say it with me! Cat!

43
00:02:38,247 --> 00:02:39,788
Cats love to sleep and play!

44
00:02:41,588 --> 00:02:44,790
Wow! Great job, friends! You guessed all the animals!

45
00:02:45,290 --> 00:02:46,993
Which animal is your favourite?

46
00:02:47,993 --> 00:02:49,626
Bye bye! See you next time!

